{"overview":"آکادمی جادوی آرنولد مدرسه‌ای برای نخبگان است... و ری وایت فقط یک آدم عادی است. در واقع او به نظر نمی‌رسد مهارت خاصی در جادو داشته باشد و کمی دست و پا چلفتی است. به همین دلیل او هیچ ارتباطی با شایعه‌ای که می‌گوید یکی از جادوگران بزرگ، جادوگر برف‌تیغ، عضو کلاس ورودی است... ندارد، درست است؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Arnold Academy of Magic is a school for the elite...and Ray White is just your ordinary guy. In fact, he doesn't seem particularly skilled with magic at all, and is a bit of a klutz. Which is why he has nothing to do with the rumor that one of the great magicians, the Iceblade Sorcerer, is a member of the incoming class...right?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2023,"poster":"/aiJd0oGkBhf98uEH3F3yC7O48vr.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/uI4HTDXiOgQStCucFA4I1DUvxbe.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"جونیا انوکی","role":"Ray White (voice)","photo":"/vBnNL3Jqy0zkS3ZgsXZmvDM9Dfz.jpg","en":"Junya Enoki"},{"name":"佐伯伊織","role":"Amelia Rose (voice)","photo":"/sh4p5hiUgpwOPErjtcXGlEzrHK.jpg","en":"Iori Saeki"},{"name":"春村奈々","role":"Elisa Griffith (voice)","photo":"/sF0z3QKRM8xuGSN7hRiVnwbqryI.jpg","en":"Nana Harumura"},{"name":"和氣あず未","role":"Rebecca Bradley (voice)","photo":"/nxm4DLWv0BOcK2owvAz5yafSAXj.jpg","en":"Azumi Waki"},{"name":"کائده هوندو","role":"Claris Cleveland (voice)","photo":"/11BcHnuJYrOZhIftgUiQqfm7TK6.jpg","en":"Kaede Hondo"},{"name":"関根明良","role":"Ariane Algren (voice)","photo":"/czYoPzAEK1gI7RxRiPyDSFYRm5x.jpg","en":"Akira Sekine"},{"name":"آتسومی تانه‌زاکی","role":"Lydia Ainsworth (voice)","photo":"/6tM8GU7QvrdUCvR4kxqVUZivtvO.jpg","en":"Atsumi Tanezaki"},{"name":"森なな子","role":"Abbie Garnet (voice)","photo":"/pWnGeuTEA4OUA8lcpl6yWVsC5tg.jpg","en":"Nanako Mori"},{"name":"مایا اوچیدا","role":"Carol Caroline (voice)","photo":"/lrcxZXkIgHU55dMs8C4DKkUohqJ.jpg","en":"Maaya Uchida"},{"name":"梅